### 1. Lista plugins detectados por reflexión
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reflection/plugins

### 2. Inspecciona metadatos del plugin CARD
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reflection/plugins/CARD/inspect

### 3. Procesa un pago con invocación reflectiva
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "paymentId": "PAY-1001",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "currency": "PEN",
  "instrumentType": "CARD",
  "pan": "4111111111111111",
  "cardHolder": "Cliente Demo",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2030,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### 4. Consulta métricas de Reflection
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reflection/metrics

### 5. Recarga el catálogo y reconstruye el registro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/reflection/plugins/reload
